<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money mkt shortage rises to 9.064 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money mkt shortage rises to 9.064 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage rose to 9.064 billion rand on Monday from 8.745 billion on Saturday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
</text>
